om/image/thumb/Purple211/v4/ee/43/d4/ee43d401-ab4c-c9b7-c98c-77bc3b2f2a06/AppIcon-0-0-1x_U007emarketing-0-10-0-85-220.png/100x100bb.jpg\",\"artworkUrl512\":\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Purple211/v4/ee/43/d4/ee43d401-ab4c-c9b7-c98c-77bc3b2f2a06/AppIcon-0-0-1x_U007emarketing-0-10-0-85-220.png/512x512bb.jpg\",\"artworkUrl60\":\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Purple211/v4/ee/43/d4/ee43d401-ab4c-c9b7-c98c-77bc3b2f2a06/AppIcon-0-0-1x_U007emarketing-0-10-0-85-220.png/60x60bb.jpg\",\"averageUserRating\":4.75121,\"averageUserRatingForCurrentVersion\":4.75121,\"bundleId\":\"com.sevenbyteson.DailyQuote\",\"contentAdvisoryRating\":\"4+\",\"currency\":\"USD\",\"currentVersionReleaseDate\":\"2024-05-31T06:39:05Z\",\"description\":\"Inspirational and motivational quotes. Daily reminders to help you overcome adversity, persevere, achieve your goals, succeed. Start your day with a quote from our thoughtfully curated collection.\\n\\nDAILY QUOTE WALLPAPERS\\nMeaningful photography and typography, hand-picked, and carefully combined to make quotes more impactful.\\n\\nIMPORTANT: iPhone wallpapers are optimized for iPhone XS, iPhone XS Max, iPhone XR, iPhone X, iPhone 8 & iPhone 8 Plus, iPhone 7 & 7 Plus, iPhone 6s & 6s Plus!\\n\\nAUDIO QUOTES \\nHave quotes read aloud by Siri! From your lock screen! Get a “pick me up” whenever you need it with Audio Quotes.\\n\\nUse a phrase, such as “Motivate me”, “Inspire me”, “Activate positivity”. Choose from different categories:\\n\\n• The Quote of the Day\\n• Our Most Popular Quotes\\n• Inspirational Quotes\\n• Motivational Quotes\\n• Positive Mindset Quotes\\n• Success Quotes\\n\\nAudio Quotes require an in-app purchase. See below for more details.\\n\\nSIRI SHORTCUTS\\nIn addition to Audio Quotes, you can personalize and add Siri Shortcuts for most essential features.\\n\\nWhy should you download the Daily Quote app?\\n\\n• Downloaded and enjoyed by MILLIONS of people!\\n• Recognized as one of the \\\"favorite gadgets\\\" of former Girl Scouts CEO Anna Maria Chávez.\\n• Featured in Success Magazine article titled \\\"A New You: Reinvent yourself with these apps\\\"\\n\\nHere are just a couple reviews we're proud of (and truly humbled by):\\n\\nAmazing! by Sam.i.am\\nAmazing is only one word to describe this app. It always has meaningful quotes that really can push yourself to do better! I would definitely encourage people to get this app!\\n\\nWorks well by LolaBarbie\\nI had this app for about 3 years! Works well!\\n\\nDaily Inspiration by 123becky\\nLove seeing my DailyQuote. They put hope for the day and motivate me with a positive attitude in facing each new day. Especially since I am handicapped living in pain every day. So I do look forward to my daily inspiration.\\n\\nIt's simple but helpful! by NickiBYU\\nI've had this app for over a year now and it's been great. No kinks or anything just a simple quote every morning to remind me of important ways to be that help me throughout the day. I love it!\\n\\nFEATURES\\nOur goal is to provide motivational and inspirational quotes each day. \\n\\n• Set reminders to view your daily quote\\n• Save your favorite quotes\\n• Add hashtags to your favorite quotes so you can easily find them later\\n• Add quotes\\n• Set a custom background photo, or choose from our free collection\\n• Browse a mix of quotes from our collection\\n\\nCreate And Share\\n• Create quote wallpapers for uses as backgrounds and lock screen wallpapers\\n• Customize font size, font color, and layout, before saving or sharing \\n• Add emoji or add additional text to quotes\\n• Select from custom background photos and background colors\\n• Easily share quotes on Instagram\\n\\n\\\"Create And Share\\\" requires our companion app, QWP, which is also available as a free download. \\n\\nPREMIUM FEATURES\\n• Audio Quotes\\n• Quote Search\\n• Ad-free usage\\n\\nDaily Quote is free to download and use. We also have premium features that require an in-app purchase. You can choose a single, one-time purchase, for lifetime access. Or you can purchase a yearly, or monthly, auto-renewing subscription. \\n\\nIf you choose to subscribe, your subscription will automatically renew and charge your credit card through your iTunes account. You can turn off auto-renew at any time from your iTunes account settings. Payment will be charged to iTunes Account at confirmation of purchase. Subscription automatically renews unless auto-renew is turned off at least 24-hours before the end of the current period. Any unused portion of a free trial period will be forfeited after purchase.\\n\\nDailyQuote privacy policy: http://dailyqotd.com/privacy\\n\\nDailyQuote terms of use: http://dailyqotd.com/user-agreement\\n\\nWe're grateful for your continuous support. If you have any questions or suggestions on how we can improve the app, please do not hesitate to contact us at http://dailyqotd.com/feedback\",\"features\":[\"iosUniversal\"],\"fileSizeBytes\":\"156255232\",\"formattedPrice\":\"Free\",\"genreIds\":[\"6012\",\"6006\"],\"genres\":[\"Lifestyle\",\"Reference\"],\"ipadScreenshotUrls\":[\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Purple116/v4/16/82/69/1682695d-9b85-f4be-d0f5-3338768cfdc3/3a492c27-059a-4750-a74b-3403650fb959_pad-2g-1.png/576x768bb.png\",\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Purple126/v4/58/0f/d4/580fd4b5-e6d3-533d-a3a0-1df556f5d89b/02b0881b-3f84-40d2-b328-b8bf1a63d5ba_pad-2g-2.png/576x768bb.png\",\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Purple116/v4/8b/b2/64/8bb264e9-b9a3-b336-9705-a59c907ad68c/fb5132b5-a4ba-4db2-9b82-1bb3d2d9429a_pad-2g-3.png/576x768bb.png\",\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Purple116/v4/3b/4c/6b/3b4c6ba6-0e92-608c-f171-ff6585cf49f8/74b908ff-a570-4089-ac41-4d2b1c2f9970_pad-2g-4.png/576x768bb.png\",\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Purple126/v4/4b/27/a8/4b27a8f4-edee-5e32-7e78-8ea0175b3759/6fd2f403-e3e3-4f19-ae39-dbf0c4ca32bc_pad-2g-5.png/576x768bb.png\",\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Pu